Readable chart labels (1.13.1)

Reported as: the project-status box on the dashboard is unreadable.

recharts draws axis labels with a hardcoded rgb(102,102,102). Against the
dark panel that is roughly 3:1 — below the 4.5:1 minimum for 11px text,
and it only got worse on the darker palettes. Ticks and grid lines use
--color-muted-foreground and --color-border now, so they follow whichever
theme and palette is active instead of assuming a light background.

Six axes across all three dashboard charts had it, not just the one that
was reported.

Category labels also gained a tick margin: they sat 8px from the end of
the bar and would touch it on fuller data.

